  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758571,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 - The World Is Not Enough (Game Boy Color)\n\nStep into the shoes of James Bond in *007 - The World Is Not Enough*, a thrilling first-person shooter for the Game Boy Color! Based on the 1999 film, this handheld adventure plunges you into a world of espionage, high-tech gadgets, and perilous missions. \n\nDeveloped by Black Ops Entertainment, this title builds upon the foundation of their previous James Bond game, *Tomorrow Never Dies*, delivering a unique, top-down perspective experience. Navigate through eight action-packed missions, rescuing hostages, destroying vehicles, and uncovering secrets. Utilize iconic Bond gadgets like the Credit Card Lockpick and Micro Camera to overcome obstacles and infiltrate enemy strongholds. \n\nWhile lacking multiplayer and save features, the game offers passwords to unlock later levels and cheats. Engage in real-time combat with a variety of weapons, from submachine guns to rocket launchers, and test your skills in a tense blackjack sequence. Experience the excitement of being 007, all within the vibrant world of the Game Boy Color!"
    },
